  "@authDivider": {
    "description": "The label in the divider. Transcribed: LoginScreen.tsx:78.\n\n`HairlineDivider`'s own doc records why this is a caller string at all: `LoginPage` passes this and has nothing else to say, so a hard-coded English literal in `core/` would be the half-translated UI this app exists not to ship."
