  "@authContinueWithGoogle": {
    "description": "The Google button. Transcribed: LoginScreen.tsx:84.\n\nThis control, and the three beside it, SHIP DISABLED by design — there is no auth endpoint on the backend (AGENT_CONTEXT §2 decision 3) — which is why `authUnavailableSuffix` exists."
