  "@settingsReduceMotion": {
    "description": "The switch's row title. **Written, not transcribed — and there is no prototype row to transcribe from**: `SettingsScreen.tsx` has no motion row at all. This control exists because AGENT_CONTEXT §14 asks for reduced motion and `app.dart` recorded that a later phase would replace the platform-only default with the persisted `UserSettings` value. This is that phase.\n\nPlaced under APPEARANCE rather than READING because what it changes is how the app moves, not what it says."
